config BR2_PACKAGE_VIRTIO_WIN_GUEST_TOOLS
	bool "virtio-win-guest-tools"
	help
	  The official VirtIO-Win "Guest Tools" installers (virtio-win-gt-x64.msi
	  and virtio-win-gt-x86.msi): VirtIO drivers plus the QEMU guest agent and
	  SPICE vdagent, bundled for one-click install inside a Windows guest.
	  Exposed to Windows VMs as a small virtual USB drive by the qemu
	  launcher.

	  https://github.com/virtio-win/kvm-guest-drivers-windows
